Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Replace CMAKE_SOURCE_DIR with PROJECT_SOURCE_DIR for
 FetchContent

CMAKE_SOURCE_DIR always points to the top-level project root, which is
wrong when OpenCC is included via FetchContent or add_subdirectory.
PROJECT_SOURCE_DIR correctly resolves to OpenCC's own source tree
regardless of how it is pulled in.

Assisted-by: Claude:glm-5.1
